.\" derpi.1 - man page for Derpi CLI
.TH DERPI 1 "2026" "derpi 2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
derpi \- CLI for searching, browsing and downloading art from Derpibooru
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B derpi
[\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fB\-\-config\fR] \fIcommand\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B derpi
is a command-line tool for interacting with the Derpibooru API
(https://derpibooru.org/pages/api).
It allows you to search for images by tags, filter them by score,
faves, size, date, uploader, and download files locally.
.PP
The tool respects the API rate limit (20 requests / 10 seconds): it
inserts a pause between requests, and on HTTP 429 it waits 10 seconds
and retries the request. File downloads go through the CDN at
derpicdn.net and do not consume the API rate limit.
.PP
Configuration is stored in
.IR ~/.config/derpi-cli/config.json .
On first run the config is created interactively.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B search \fItags\fR
Search for images. Prints ID, score, faves, size, tags and a link.
.TP
.B download \fItags\fR
Download images by tags with pagination.
.TP
.B info \fIID\fR
Show details for a single image by ID.
.TP
.B random \fR[\fItags\fR]
Fetch a random image matching the given tags (or none).
.TP
.B tags \fIname\fR [\fIname ...\fR]
Show information about tags: category, image count, description.
.SH GLOBAL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-config
Print the path to the config file and exit.
.SH SEARCH AND DOWNLOAD OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-page \fIN\fR
Page number (default: 1).
.TP
.B \-\-per\-page \fIN\fR
Results per page, 1\-50 (default: 50).
.TP
.B \-\-sort \fIFIELD\fR
Sort field: created_at, score, faves, wilson_score, random,
updated_at, tag_count, width, height, first_seen_at.
.TP
.B \-\-dir \fIDIRECTION\fR
Sort direction: desc or asc (default: desc).
.TP
.B \-\-min\-score \fIN\fR
Minimum score.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-score \fIN\fR
Maximum score.
.TP
.B \-\-min\-faves \fIN\fR
Minimum number of faves.
.TP
.B \-\-min\-upvotes \fIN\fR
Minimum number of upvotes.
.TP
.B \-\-min\-wilson \fIF\fR
Minimum Wilson score (0.0\-1.0).
.TP
.B \-\-min\-width \fIN\fR
Minimum width in pixels.
.TP
.B \-\-min\-height \fIN\fR
Minimum height in pixels.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-width \fIN\fR
Maximum width in pixels.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-height \fIN\fR
Maximum height in pixels.
.TP
.B \-\-uploader \fINAME\fR
Filter by uploader name.
.TP
.B \-\-gallery \fIID\fR
Filter by gallery ID.
.TP
.B \-\-faved\-by \fINAME\fR
Images faved by the given user.
.TP
.B \-\-upvoted\-by \fINAME\fR
Images upvoted by the given user.
.TP
.B \-\-watched
Only images from your watchlist (requires an API key).
.TP
.B \-\-min\-tag\-count \fIN\fR
Minimum number of tags.
.TP
.B \-\-max\-tag\-count \fIN\fR
Maximum number of tags.
.TP
.B \-\-first\-seen\-after \fIDATE\fR
Images first seen after the given date (YYYY-MM-DD).
.TP
.B \-\-first\-seen\-before \fIDATE\fR
Images first seen before the given date (YYYY-MM-DD).
.TP
.B \-\-created\-at\-after \fIDATE\fR
Images uploaded after the given date (YYYY-MM-DD).
.TP
.B \-\-created\-at\-before \fIDATE\fR
Images uploaded before the given date (YYYY-MM-DD).
.SH SEARCH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output the raw result as JSON.
.SH DOWNLOAD OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-o, \-\-output \fIDIR\fR
Output directory (default from config).
.TP
.B \-\-limit \fIN\fR
Maximum number of files to download (default: 50).
.TP
.B \-\-size \fISIZE\fR
Image size: full, large, medium, small, thumb (default: full).
.SH INFO AND RANDOM OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output as JSON.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/derpi-cli/config.json
Configuration file: API key, request delay, default output
directory, filter ID. Created on first run with mode 0600.
.SH CONFIGURATION
JSON format:
.PP
.nf
{
  "api_key": "",
  "rate_limit_delay": 0.5,
  "default_filter_id": null,
  "default_output_dir": "./downloads"
}
.fi
.PP
If
.I api_key
is set, the tool uses your account's personal filters and can
access your watchlist. The
.I rate_limit_delay
value sets the pause between API requests, in seconds.
.SH EXAMPLES
Find the top 10 by score:
.PP
.nf
derpi search "fluttershy, safe" --sort score --per-page 10
.fi
.PP
Download 20 wallpapers at 1920x1080 or larger:
.PP
.nf
derpi download "wallpaper, safe" --min-width 1920 \\
    --min-height 1080 --limit 20 -o ./wallpapers
.fi
.PP
Fetch a random high-score image:
.PP
.nf
derpi random "rarity, safe, score.gt:100"
.fi
.PP
Show information about a tag:
.PP
.nf
derpi tags fluttershy
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR curl (1),
.BR jq (1)
.PP
API documentation: https://derpibooru.org/pages/api
